Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: standalone librarian character illustration for the muQ online library.
Primary request: a tasteful Touhou Project Koakuma fan-art librarian, recognizable as Koakuma, with long deep auburn-red hair, red-brown eyes and small black bat wings at the sides of her head. A modest pair of black bat wings on her back, smaller than her body and fully within the frame. Young adult appearance, warm intelligent expression, gentle welcoming smile. White collared blouse, dark plum-black sleeveless long dress / waistcoat and skirt, restrained burgundy necktie. Modest, fully clothed.
Pose: standing naturally in a gentle three-quarter view toward the viewer, holding one closed antique book securely against her torso with both hands. Clear, anatomically coherent hands. Entire figure visible, including hair, wings, skirt and shoes, with comfortable margins.
Style: refined Japanese anime character illustration, delicate confident linework, softly painted cel shading, restrained detail that remains legible at small website sizes. Elegant and approachable, a quiet library assistant.
Palette: auburn hair as the warm accent; dark plum #292332 and #665173, ivory #f5f1eb, muted gold #dfcba2 for subtle book ornament. Soft diffuse lighting with readable dark clothing contours.
Composition: one character only, portrait canvas, centered silhouette. Plain uniform background for easy extraction; no room, no furniture, no floor shadow, no effects outside the silhouette.
Text: none.
Avoid: horns, pointed tail, angel wings, large fantasy weapons, maid headdress, purple hair, extra limbs or fingers, detached objects, sexualized costume, chibi proportions, typography, logos, watermark, border, character sheet.
